        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6942 Mortise Bismark Entry Set with 5152 Drop Tail Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTraditional in design, this Baldwin made mortise entry set is perfect to enhance the glamour of any classic decor. It is available in  beautiful finishes with a single cylinder, a double cylinder, or a dummy set function. ADA compliant, the 6942 Bismark Estate Entryset comes with the ever popular 5152 Drop Tail Lever for that added touch of timeless elegance. It will fit 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMortise locks have been, and still are, the established norm for Europe and much of the rest of the world. In the early 1960’s Baldwin brought residential mortise locks to America. They ‘founded’ the residential mortise industry and continue to be the leader – so much so that their competitors have bought Baldwin locks for their own products.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional 6942 Bismark Door Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Certified by Underwriters Laboratories (UL) for use on fire doors up to three-hour rating.</li>\r\n<li>Accessibility Code (ADA) A117.1</li>\r\n<li>Made of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-duty mortise lock body.</li>\r\n<li>Forged brass mechanical.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt with two hardened inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced steel security strike with three inch screws.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with two keys.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, operation, and 003 PVD Polished Brass finish.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Estate Collection Bismark Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 5152 Lever</li>\r\n<li>Length: 8.312\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Width: 1.703\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" or 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset:  2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-6942.pdf?v=1691094973\" target=\"new\"><b>Bismark Entry Set Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-estate_mortise_dimensions.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Mortise Box Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<B>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><B>Full Dummy Set:</B> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><B>Single Cylinder:</B> From the exterior, a lever operates the entrance set latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a lever operates entrance set latch; while from the interior, it is operated by a lever. The deadbolt is operated by a key from both the inside and the outside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-3-Functions-entryset.jpg?v=1704354505\" width=\"350\" height=\"125\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Functions Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Bismark Mortise Entry Set, Baldwin 6942",
                "description": "Baldwin 6942 Bismark Entrance Set - Traditional in design, this Baldwin made mortise entry set is perfect to enhance the glamour of any classic decor. It is available in 4 beautiful finishes with a single cylinder, an emergency, a double cylinder, or a dummy set function. ADA compliant, the 6942 Bismark Estate Entryset comes with the ever popular 5152 Drop Tail Lever for that added touch of timeless elegance. It will fit 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
